{"1-8":{"people":[{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":8,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"hadadezer-h1909","name":"Hadadezer","kind":"person","brief":"King of Zobah","count":4,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"rehob-h7340i","name":"Rehob","kind":"person","brief":"David's opponent","count":1,"firstVerse":3}],"places":[{"id":"gath-h1661","name":"Gath","kind":"place","brief":"In Philistia","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"philistia-h6429","name":"Philistia","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"moab-h4124g","name":"Moab","kind":"place","brief":"In Edom","count":1,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"zobah-h6678g","name":"Zobah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"euphrates-h6578","name":"Euphrates","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"damascus-h1834","name":"Damascus","kind":"place","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"syria-h0758i","name":"Syria","kind":"place","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"jerusalem-h3389","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"berothah-h1268a","name":"Berothah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"betah-h0984","name":"Betah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8}],"words":[{"base":"H1732","lemma":"דָּוִד","tr":"da·vid","gloss":"David","lang":"h","inPassage":12,"uses":1075},{"base":"H1909","lemma":"הֲדַדְעֶ֫זֶר","tr":"ha·dad·e·zer","gloss":"Hadadezer","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":9},{"base":"H0758","lemma":"אֲרָם","tr":"a·ram","gloss":"Aram","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":143},{"base":"H2256","lemma":"חֶ֫בֶל","tr":"che·vel","gloss":"Mahalab","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":62},{"base":"H4965","lemma":"מֶתֶג הָאַמָּה","tr":"me·teg ha·am·mah","gloss":"Metheg-ammah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":2},{"base":"H5221","lemma":"נָכָה","tr":"na·khah","gloss":"to smite","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":500},{"base":"H6678","lemma":"צוֹבָא","tr":"tso·va","gloss":"Zobah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":12},{"base":"H1834","lemma":"דַּמֶּ֫שֶׂק","tr":"dam·me·seq","gloss":"Damascus","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":45},{"base":"H0505","lemma":"אֶ֫לֶף","tr":"e·leph","gloss":"thousand","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":506},{"base":"H4058","lemma":"מָדַד","tr":"ma·dad","gloss":"to measure","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":51}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"2SA","chapter":8,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"He placed garrisons throughout Edom, and all the Edomites were subject to David. So the LORD made David victorious wherever he went.","from":6},{"book":"NUM","chapter":24,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"I see him, but not now; I behold him, but not near. A star will come forth from Jacob, and a scepter will arise from Israel. He will crush the skulls of Moab and strike down all the sons of Sheth.","from":2},{"book":"1SA","chapter":14,"verse":47,"verseEnd":47,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"After Saul had assumed the kingship over Israel, he fought against all his enemies on every side—the Moabites, the Ammonites, the Edomites, the kings of Zobah, and the Philistines. Wherever he turned, he routed them.","from":3},{"book":"GEN","chapter":15,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"On that day the Lordmade a covenant with Abram, saying, “To your descendants I have given this land—from the river of Egypt to the great River Euphrates—","from":3},{"book":"EXO","chapter":23,"verse":31,"verseEnd":31,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And I will establish your borders from the Red Sea to the Sea of the Philistines, and from the desert to the Euphrates. For I will deliver the inhabitants into your hand, and you will drive them out before you.","from":3},{"book":"DEU","chapter":11,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Every place where the sole of your foot treads will be yours. Your territory will extend from the wilderness to Lebanon, and from the Euphrates River to the Western Sea.","from":3},{"book":"DEU","chapter":17,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But the king must not acquire many horses for himself or send the people back to Egypt to acquire more horses, for the LORD has said, ‘You are never to go back that way again.’","from":4},{"book":"JOS","chapter":11,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then the LORD said to Joshua, “Do not be afraid of them, for by this time tomorrow I will deliver all of them slain before Israel. You are to hamstring their horses and burn up their chariots.”","from":4}],"notes":[{"id":"num-24-17-star","title":"A star will come out of Jacob","kind":"prophecy"}],"groups":[]},"9-14":{"people":[{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":5,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"hadadezer-h1909","name":"Hadadezer","kind":"person","brief":"King of Zobah","count":3,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"toi-h8583","name":"Toi","kind":"person","brief":"Syrian king","count":2,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"joram-h3141g","name":"Joram","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Toi","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"rehob-h7340i","name":"Rehob","kind":"person","brief":"David's opponent","count":1,"firstVerse":12}],"places":[{"id":"hamath-h2574g","name":"Hamath","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"edom-h0123g","name":"Edom","kind":"place","brief":"In Edom","count":3,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"amalek-h6002g","name":"Amalek","kind":"place","brief":"In Edom","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"ammon-h5983","name":"Ammon","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"moab-h4124g","name":"Moab","kind":"place","brief":"In Edom","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"philistia-h6429","name":"Philistia","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"zobah-h6678g","name":"Zobah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"salt-valley-h4417h","name":"Salt Valley","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":13}],"words":[{"base":"H1909","lemma":"הֲדַדְעֶ֫זֶר","tr":"ha·dad·e·zer","gloss":"Hadadezer","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":9},{"base":"H8583","lemma":"תֹּ֫עִי, תֹּעוּ","tr":"to·u","gloss":"Toi","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":5},{"base":"H1732","lemma":"דָּוִד","tr":"da·vid","gloss":"David","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":1075},{"base":"H0123","lemma":"אֱדוֹם","tr":"e·dom","gloss":"Edom","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":100},{"base":"H5333","lemma":"נְצִיב","tr":"ne·tsiv","gloss":"garrison","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":11},{"base":"H3627","lemma":"כְּלִי","tr":"ke·li","gloss":"article","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":325},{"base":"H5221","lemma":"נָכָה","tr":"na·khah","gloss":"to smite","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":500},{"base":"H0758","lemma":"אֲרָם","tr":"a·ram","gloss":"Aram","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":143},{"base":"H6942","lemma":"קָדַשׁ","tr":"qa·dash","gloss":"to consecrate: consecate","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":171},{"base":"H2091","lemma":"זָהָב","tr":"za·hav","gloss":"gold","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":389}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"2SA","chapter":10,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"When the Ammonites saw that the Arameans had fled, they too fled before Abishai, and they entered the city. So Joab returned from fighting against the Ammonites and came to Jerusalem.","from":12},{"book":"1KI","chapter":7,"verse":51,"verseEnd":51,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"So all the work that King Solomon had performed for the house of the LORD was completed. Then Solomon brought in the items his father David had dedicated—the silver, the gold, and the furnishings—and he placed them in the treasuries of the house of the LORD.","from":11},{"book":"2KI","chapter":14,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Amaziah struck down 10,000 Edomites in the Valley of Salt. He took Sela in battle and called it Joktheel, which is its name to this very day.","from":13},{"book":"GEN","chapter":25,"verse":23,"verseEnd":23,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"and He declared to her: “Two nations are in your womb, and two peoples from within you will be separated; one people will be stronger than the other, and the older will serve the younger.”","from":14},{"book":"GEN","chapter":27,"verse":29,"verseEnd":29,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"May peoples serve you and nations bow down to you. May you be the master of your brothers, and may the sons of your mother bow down to you. May those who curse you be cursed, and those who bless you be blessed.”","from":14},{"book":"GEN","chapter":27,"verse":37,"verseEnd":37,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But Isaac answered Esau: “Look, I have made him your master and given him all his relatives as servants; I have sustained him with grain and new wine. What is left that I can do for you, my son?”","from":14},{"book":"GEN","chapter":27,"verse":40,"verseEnd":40,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"You shall live by the sword and serve your brother. But when you rebel, you will tear his yoke from your neck.”","from":14},{"book":"GEN","chapter":43,"verse":27,"verseEnd":27,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"He asked if they were well, and then he asked, “How is your elderly father you told me about? Is he still alive?”","from":10}],"notes":[{"id":"gen-25-23-older-serve","title":"Two nations in your womb","kind":"prophecy"}],"groups":[]},"15-18":{"people":[{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":2,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"ahilud-h0286","name":"Ahilud","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Jehoshaphat","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"jehoshaphat-h3092g","name":"Jehoshaphat","kind":"person","brief":"David's compatriot","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"joab-h3097g","name":"Joab","kind":"person","brief":"David's compatriot","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"zeruiah-h6870g","name":"Zeruiah","kind":"person","brief":"Sister of David","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"abiathar-h0054","name":"Abiathar","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":17},{"id":"ahimelech-h0288i","name":"Ahimelech","kind":"person","brief":"A priest","count":1,"firstVerse":17},{"id":"ahitub-h0285h","name":"Ahitub","kind":"person","brief":"A priest","count":1,"firstVerse":17},{"id":"seraiah-h8304g","name":"Seraiah","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Elihoreph","count":1,"firstVerse":17},{"id":"zadok-h6659g","name":"Zadok","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":17},{"id":"benaiah-h1141g","name":"Benaiah","kind":"person","brief":"David's warrior","count":1,"firstVerse":18},{"id":"cherethites-h3774h","name":"Cherethites","kind":"person","brief":"Royal guards","count":1,"firstVerse":18},{"id":"jehoiada-h3077g","name":"Jehoiada","kind":"person","brief":"Father of warrior Benaiah","count":1,"firstVerse":18},{"id":"pelethites-h6432","name":"Pelethites","kind":"person","brief":"David's warriors","count":1,"firstVerse":18}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H1732","lemma":"דָּוִד","tr":"da·vid","gloss":"David","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":1075},{"base":"H0286","lemma":"אֲחִילוּד","tr":"a·chi·lud","gloss":"Ahilud","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"H6432","lemma":"פְּלֵתִי","tr":"pe·le·ti","gloss":"Pelethite","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":7},{"base":"H3548","lemma":"כֹּהֵן","tr":"ko·hen","gloss":"priest","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":750},{"base":"H3774","lemma":"כְּרֵתִי","tr":"ke·re·ti","gloss":"Cherethite","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":10},{"base":"H0285","lemma":"אֲחִיטוּב","tr":"a·chi·tuv","gloss":"Ahitub","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":15},{"base":"H0288","lemma":"אֲחִימֶ֫לֶךְ","tr":"a·chi·me·lekh","gloss":"Ahimelech","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":17},{"base":"H8304","lemma":"שְׂרָיָהוּ","tr":"se·ra·yah","gloss":"Seraiah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":20},{"base":"H6870","lemma":"צְרוּיָה","tr":"tse·ru·yah","gloss":"Zeruiah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":26},{"base":"H0054","lemma":"אֶבְיָתָר","tr":"ev·ya·tar","gloss":"Abiathar","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":30}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1SA","chapter":30,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"We raided the Negev of the Cherethites, the territory of Judah, and the Negev of Caleb, and we burned down Ziklag.”","from":18},{"book":"1KI","chapter":4,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Elihoreph and Ahijah, the sons of Shisha, were secretaries; Jehoshaphat son of Ahilud was the recorder;","from":16},{"book":"AMO","chapter":5,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Hate evil and love good; establish justice in the gate. Perhaps the LORD, the God of Hosts, will be gracious to the remnant of Joseph.”","from":15},{"book":"2SA","chapter":3,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then Abner sent messengers on his behalf to say to David, “To whom does the land belong? Make your covenant with me, and surely my hand will be with you to bring all Israel over to you.”","from":15},{"book":"2SA","chapter":5,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"In Hebron he reigned over Judah seven years and six months, and in Jerusalem he reigned thirty-three years over all Israel and Judah.","from":15},{"book":"2SA","chapter":15,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"and all his servants marched past him—all the Cherethites and Pelethites, and six hundred Gittites who had followed him from Gath.","from":18},{"book":"2SA","chapter":19,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And say to Amasa, ‘Arenʼt you my flesh and blood? May God punish me, and ever so severely, if from now on you are not the commander of my army in place of Joab!’”","from":16},{"book":"2SA","chapter":20,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So Joabʼs men, along with the Cherethites, the Pelethites, and all the mighty men, marched out of Jerusalem in pursuit of Sheba son of Bichri.","from":18}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"kings-prophets","title":"Kings, prophets and the house of David","people":5}]}}